985dccd4c9c"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is lots of fun. It has randomized levels, enemy spawn locations, etc. Every time you play it, you will experience something different. This game has great graphics and runs very well (my computer is meh and i get 110-120 fps). The price is at $20, which is cheaper than most games, and it provides just as much fun and replayability, if not more. I would give it a 9.5/10 and i would definitely recommend it.", "timestamp_created": 1586993368, "timestamp_updated": 1586993368, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "67398038", "author": {"steamid": "76561197960287106", "personaname": "Neo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/1822N30/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 32220, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3793, "last_played": 1774745652, "avatar": "b236a22ac9a4cdf94aa03faec2ea11e9cda37598"}, "language": "english", "review": "I have bought this 5 or 6 times for other people I love it they love it thank you very much.\n\nIf you are on the fence about this game it is worth ever penny! You lose track of time and get nothing done. Forget work this is life as is Shrek.\n\nThe modding expands this game to an entire new level. Modding is pretty easy to do as well. I would recommend modding it if you somehow manage to get bored with the vanilla game.\n\nUpdate after many more hours. It is still fun. (Nov 2022)\n\nI just learned that Gearbox purchased the RoR IP and I think that's fine. The original devs of the game feel they have done everything they set out to do in the game and they felt comfortable enough with Gearbox taking it over. I would still recommend this game.", "timestamp_created": 1586992828, "timestamp_updated": 1669598216, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "67397210", "author": {"steamid": "76561198086188649", "personaname": "Question", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/CorruptedFren/", "num_games_owned": 446, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 6480, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 960, "last_played": 1720455118, "avatar": "5fea668694c95ff82c2d9cc2b2afdb06a9d2bbb4"}, "language": "english", "review": "is gud\n", "timestamp_created": 1586991600, "timestamp_updated": 1586991600, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "67397140", "author": {"steamid": "76561198134752698", "personaname": "PatrickTheGuy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/PatrickTheGuy/", "num_games_owned": 117, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 37253, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 463, "playtime_at_review": 10690, "last_played": 1788759451, "avatar": "78d722c6a2a031eb3ab5da4d1cbee6b0f6505066"}, "language": "english", "review": "Commando Monsoon\n\nThank\n\nMe Later", "timestamp_created": 1586991499, "timestamp_updated": 1586991499, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app